es-ES","overview":"España, años setenta. Mientras una cruel dictadura gobierna un país eternamente gris a través del miedo, la violencia, la represión y la censura, María, una joven bailarina, sueña con dotar de colores vivos a su vida y a la de los demás, mientras se abre paso en su camino hacia la libertad personal y persigue su loco sueño de convertirse en una estrella de la televisión; un viaje muy divertido en el que se verá reconfortada por las canciones pop de la incomparable cantante y bailarina italiana Raffaella Carrà.","tagline":"Vive el fenómeno musical"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fhQdlAw2pJZ2aGXPRNHGjzBR23l.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/acGKpM38ks3FVzs3RHqTweMHB9p.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":681509,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"es-ES","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fhQdlAw2pJZ2aGXPRNHGjzBR23l.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fhQdlAw2pJZ2aGXPRNHGjzBR23l.jpg","language":"it","width":1146,"height":1719},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fhQdlAw2pJZ2aGXPRNHGjzBR23l.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fhQdlAw2pJZ2aGXPRNHGjzBR23l.jpg","language":"it","width":1146,"height":1719},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dnl3I174kbOBnTNRd0sY0spP8zf.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dnl3I174kbOBnTNRd0sY0spP8zf.jpg","language":"it","width":1200,"height":1800}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wSfwZlSSffa8Cak70S6xWzebnnI.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wSfwZlSSffa8Cak70S6xWzebnnI.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wSfwZlSSffa8Cak70S6xWz